# Notice

## Provenance

Pergola is an independent reimplementation of the *fractal window model*
popularised by TrellisWM, a commercial macOS application. It contains no code,
assets, icons, text or data from TrellisWM, and it is not produced by, endorsed
by, or affiliated with TrellisWM or its author.

What informed this implementation, all of it public:

* the product page and public guide at <https://trelliswm.app> — command names,
  shortcut list, interaction descriptions, settings panes, plans;
* the layout grammar and invariants published in the independent clean-room
  study <https://github.com/archsueh/trelliswm-reverse> — a description of a
  file format observed on that author's machine, plus a JavaScript and a Swift
  implementation written from that description. That repository ships no
  license and grants no reuse rights, so no code was taken from it; only the
  published grammar and invariants were used.

See `docs/RESEARCH.md` for the full research note and source list.

